    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "U Baroorashadii Turos",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, haddana Turos aawadeed baroor kor ugu qayli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxaad Turos ku tidhaahdaa, Taada badda kadinkeeda ku taal, oo ah meesha ay gasiirado badan dadkoodu ka baayacmushtaraanay, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Turosay, waxaad istidhi, Anigu waxaan leeyahay qurux kaamil ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soohdimahaagu waxay ku yaallaan badda dhexdeeda, oo kuwii ku dhisayna quruxdaadii way kaamileen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alwaaxda doonniyahaaga oo dhan waxay ka sameeyeen dhirta berooshka ah ee Seniir, oo Lubnaan waxay ka soo goosteen geedo kedar ah si ay daqal kaaga dhigaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxay seebab kaaga sameeyeen geedihii alloonka ee Baashaan, oo kursiyadaadiina waxay ka sameeyeen alwaax gasiiradaha Kitiim laga keenay oo foolmaroodi lagu sharxay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa shiraaq kuu ahaa maro wanaagsan oo daabac leh oo Masar laga keenay, si ay taasu calaamad kuugu ahaato, oo waxaa kugu dednaa buluug iyo guduud gasiiradaha Eliishaah laga keenay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turosay, kuwii sixiimadahaagii seebiyey waxay ahaayeen dadka Siidoon iyo Arwaad deggan, oo kuwii xigmadda lahaa ee ku dhex joogayna waxay ahaayeen doonniyawadayaashaadii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Odayaashii Gebal iyo kuweedii xigmadda lahaa ee ku dhex joogay ayaa kuwa dillaacyada awda kuu ahaayeen, oo badda doonniyaheedii oo dhan iyo baxriyadoodii oo dhammuba way ku dhex joogeen si ay kuula baayacmushtaraan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer Faaris, iyo reer Luud, iyo reer Fuud ayaa ciidankaagii ku jiray, oo waxay kuu ahaayeen dagaalyahankaagii, oo dhexdaaday gaashaanka iyo koofiyadda dagaalka sudheen, oo waxay soo ban dhigeen quruxdaadii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo derbiyadaadii kugu wareegsanaana waxaa dul joogay raggii reer Arwad iyo ciidankaagii, oo munaaradahaagiina waxaa ku jiray raggii reer Gammaadiim. Iyana gaashaammadooday derbiyadaadii kugu wareegsanaa sudheen, oo quruxdaadiina kaamil bay ka dhigeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tarshiish waxay ahayd tii kula baayacmushtari jirtay hodantinimadaadii badnayd ee cayn kasta ahayd aawadeed, oo waxay alaabtaadii kaga baayacmushtari jirtay lacag, iyo bir, iyo qasacad, iyo alxan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Yaawaan, iyo reer Tubal, iyo reer Meshegna way kula baayacmushtari jireen, oo waxay alaabtaadii kaga baayacmushtari jireen dad noolnool iyo weelal naxaas ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwii reer Togarmaahna waxay alaabtaadii kaga baayacmushtari jireen fardo iyo fardo la fuulo iyo baqlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dadkii reer Dedaanna way kula baayacmushtari jireen, oo gasiirado badan ayaa kuu ahaan jiray meelahaad ku baayacmushtartid, oo waxay kuu keeni jireen foolmaroodi iyo qori haabniim ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suuriyana way kula baayacmushtari jirtay, maxaa yeelay, sanco faro badan baad samayn jirtay, oo waxay alaabtaada kaga baayacmushtari jireen dhagaxyo sumurud la yidhaahdo, iyo guduud, iyo daabac, iyo dhar wanaagsan, iyo shacaab iyo dhagax agate la yidhaahdo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dalka Yahuudah iyo dalka Israa'iilna way kula baayacmushtari jireen, oo waxay alaabtaada kaga baayacmushtari jireen sarreenkii Minniid, iyo fannag macaan, iyo malab, iyo saliid, iyo beeyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dimishaqna way kula baayacmushtari jirtay sancadaadii faraha badnayd aawadeed, iyo hodantinimadaadii badnayd ee cayn kasta ahayd oo dhan, oo waxay ka dhaafsan jirtay khamrigii Xelboon iyo dhogor cad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wedaan iyo Yaawaan waxay alaabtaada kaga baayacmushtareen dun, oo alaabtaadana waxaa ka mid ahaa bir dhalaalaysa iyo kasiya iyo kalamus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dedaan waxay kaga baayacmushtari jirtay dharka qaaliga ah ee fardaha lagu saldhaysto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Carabiya iyo amiirradii reer Qedaar oo dhammu waxay kuu soo iib geeysan jireen baraar, iyo wanan iyo orgi: oo waxaasay kaaga baayacmushtari jireen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Shebaa iyo reer Racmaahna way kula baayacmushtari jireen, oo waxay alaabtaadii kaga baayacmushtari jireen xawaashka ugu fiican, iyo dhagxan kasta oo qaali ah, iyo dahab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa kaloo kula baayacmushtari jiray Xaaraan, iyo Kanneeh, iyo Ceeden, iyo baayacmushtariyaashii Shebaa, iyo Ashuur, iyo Kilmad oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwaasu waxay ahaan jireen baayacmushtariyaasha kaa iibin jiray alaab door ah oo cayn kasta ah oo ahaa dhar buluug ah, iyo daabac, iyo sanaaduuq uu dhar qaali ahu ka buuxo oo ay xadhko ku xidhxidhan yihiin oo alwaax kedar ah laga sameeyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doonniyaha Tarshiish ayaa shixnaddaada qaadi jiray, oo adigu waad buuxsantay, oo badda dhexdeeda ayaad aad ugu sharaf badnayd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwii seebab kuugu kaxaynayay waxay ku geeyeen meel biyo badan, oo dabayshii bari ayaa badda dhexdeeda kugu jebisay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maalkaaga, iyo alaabtaada, iyo baayacmushtarkaaga, iyo baxriyadaada, iyo doonniyawadayaashaada, iyo kuwa dillaacyada awda, iyo kuwa baayacmushtarkaaga ka shaqaysta, iyo raggaaga dagaalyahanka ah oo ku dhex jooga oo dhan, iyo guutada ku dhex joogta oo dhammuba waxay maalinta baabbi'iddaada ku wada daadan doonaan badaha dhexdooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwa agagaarkaaga jooga oo dhammu waxay la wada gariiri doonaan qaylada dhawaaqa doonniyawadayaashaada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwa seebabka ku shaqeeya oo dhan, iyo baxriyada, iyo doonniyawadayaasha badda oo dhammuba doonniyahooda way ka soo degi doonaan, oo berrigay soo istaagi doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa la maqli doonaa iyagoo kuu barooranaya, oo si qadhaadh ayay u ooyi doonaan, oo madaxooday boodh ku dul shubi doonaan, oo dambaskay ku galgalan doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo adiga daraaddaa ayay isu xiiri doonaan, oo joonyado bay guntan doonaan, oo waxay kuugu ooyi doonaan qalbi murugaysan iyo baroor qadhaadh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo intay ooyayaan ayay baroor kuu qaadi doonaan, oo waxay ku barooran doonaan iyagoo leh, Turosta badda dhexdeeda ku baabba'day, bal magaaladee baa la mid ah? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markay alaabtaadu badda ka soo baxday dad faro badan baad dhergin jirtay, oo boqorradii dunidana hodan baad maalkaagii badnaa iyo baayacmushtarkaagii kaga dhigtay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakhtigii badaha lagugu jebiyey biyaha moolka dheer dhexdooda ayaa baayacmushtarkaagii iyo guutadaadii oo dhammuba kugu wada dhex baabbi'iyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dadka gasiiradaha deggan oo dhammu way kula yaabsan yihiin, oo boqorradooduna aad iyo aad bay u cabsan yihiin, oo wejigooduna aad buu u argaggaxsan yahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo baayacmushtariyaasha dadka ku dhex jiraa way kugu foodhyaan, oo cabsi baad noqotay, oo weligaana mar dambe ma aad jiri doontid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.36"
            ]
          }
        }
